  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>主题设计规范</strong></span></h1><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>【更新时间】：2026年9月14日</strong></span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. 概述</strong></span></h2><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.1 主题壁纸要求</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>安全优先：</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">信息识别≤2秒，避免高饱和色、复杂动态，减少驾驶干扰。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>可读优先</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">：文字与背景对比度≥4.5:1，符合无障碍标准。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>体验一致：</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">仅调整视觉风格，核心功能、操作逻辑、布局不变（例：可交互APK，不可干扰桌面默认交互逻辑）。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>多场景适配：</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">兼容昼夜光线、不同屏幕及多屏联动，保障全工况清晰度。</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.2 换肤框架</strong></span></h3><table style=\"width: auto;table-layout: fixed;height:732\"><colgroup contentEditable=\"false\"><col width=85></col><col width=100></col><col width=100></col><col width=100></col><col width=565></col><col width=569></col></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height: 59px\"><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245); border-style: solid;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89);\"><strong>名称</strong></span></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245); border-style: solid;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">预览图</span></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245); border-style: solid;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">壁纸</span></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245); border-style: solid;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图标</span></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245); border-style: solid;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">桌面效果</span></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245); border-style: solid;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">应用中心</span></th></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245); border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">主题</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(56, 158, 13); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>✔</strong></span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(56, 158, 13); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>✔</strong></span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(56, 158, 13); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>✔</strong></span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/95bdfaa85b2144f9a01af03ce5efc293.png?auth_key=1795678279-825fd156feab4505b83b6b47a7364821-0-447e57f8da915d5e100a67d73a472597805e791383c20c0bda6cfd003ba0e20b\" alt=\"效果图-1.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/6265d326ac61438f9b798a69560a1f3d.png?auth_key=1795678279-215e03cf061b4e75af5a85066e5b3d51-0-2fdabeb0f0af56353e56818112d39c0d0668234298118b00ba0847270875b5d3\" alt=\"效果图-3.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245); border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">壁纸</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(56, 158, 13); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>✔</strong></span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(56, 158, 13); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>✔</strong></span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>✘</strong></span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/4a1ad4056aa54144a67516301d2d3e33.png?auth_key=1795678279-62032395f2944a35838362c967e4b8be-0-5b6e24ddfdb1b449f288d3a4026d614c0591ccd54bac7171e67e192af33128ed\" alt=\"效果图-1.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图标不换，系统默认图标</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/d41762f3b94b499d857b9f9643094caf.png?auth_key=1795678279-703489b5e5ac460691355db2ac056ea5-0-6e78c6ee120cb0976e69712c4284dc73db60a6a0cb0da7afee38142c8853d6d1\" alt=\"效果图-2.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图标不换，系统默认图标</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">表 1-1 换肤框架</span></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. 壁纸规范</strong></span></h2><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2.1 中控壁纸</strong></span></h3><table style=\"width: auto;table-layout: fixed;height:150\"><colgroup contentEditable=\"false\"><col width=159></col><col width=231></col><col width=208></col><col width=232></col><col width=253></col></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height: 30px\"><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">中控输出尺寸</span></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">视频大小</span></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">帧率</span></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">视频时长</span></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">格式</span></th></tr><tr style=\"height: 30px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">横屏</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">2560*1440px</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"3\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">24-30FPS</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"3\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">建议小于10s，上限20s</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"3\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">MP4（注意：不带音频）</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 30px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">竖屏</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">1080*1920px</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 30px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">长屏</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">5120*1600px</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 30px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89);\">表2-1 壁纸规格要求</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>注：</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, system-ui, Roboto, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Source Han Sans SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&quot;;\"><strong>当前付费主题仅开放动态主题类型，创作者须制作动态视频进</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>行上传，</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>动态视频须保证首尾帧一致，避免循环播放时出现跳帧、闪烁或画面突变</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>。</strong></span></p><h4><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2.1.1 横屏适配方式</strong></span></h4><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">横屏输出16比9壁纸资源，16比9比例的屏幕会等比缩放，16比10的屏幕先缩放再裁切左右边缘</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/6252d6954fef49459ab072bd553783b3.jpg?auth_key=1795678279-a9a3806e21de4874aafb4aab7f17d566-0-0163677b0454429fc3f4c823be60871301567da1364486bfec22645696001d93\" alt=\"3.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 883.93px;height: 1535.89px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-2 &nbsp;横屏适配方式</span></p><h4><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2.1.2 竖屏适配方式</strong></span></h4><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">仅存在9比16的比例，实际最大尺寸1080*1920px，无需自适应裁剪。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/30a58d8bb1f2450b990f8511fa40e255.png?auth_key=1795678279-2bbc07be69f149cb835d5a3b1c1c1c4a-0-5ccbe95b82df35cf63ed2fe17506432b83e130599af13beb3983ae714234d85e\" alt=\"组合 14.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 894.96px;height: 797.06px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-3 &nbsp;竖屏适配方式</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2.2 副驾壁纸</strong></span></h3><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>支持格式</strong></span></li></ul><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">副驾壁纸暂时</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>不支持动态视频和可交互apk</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>支持png/jpg</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>输出尺寸</strong></span></li></ul><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">副驾尺寸：</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2560*720px</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>输出建议</strong></span></li></ul><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">背景高斯模糊，对清晰度和码率要求不高，建议输出</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>JPG</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">节省资源空间。</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>适配方式</strong></span></li></ul><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">按照32比9输出，24比9屏幕</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>自动裁切</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">左右边缘</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/4ddb74cac48a445cb9af6760792f2c89.jpg?auth_key=1795678279-79ce1cb31bb940739697e2a5f6744ba5-0-462a51f0915ba85d050f6125476530f72b4b8b3b88f11b0e747e034af0646cad\" alt=\"壁纸规范 -副驾.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1170.96px;height: 1046.55px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-3 &nbsp;副驾屏适配方式</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>3. 图标规范</strong></span></h2><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>3.1 数量、尺寸要求</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>必做图标</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>68个</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>，包含通用图标及第三方图标。</strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">应用图标切图尺寸144px，如非矢量图，建议设计尺寸288px，设计资源应满足最小应用场景72px下图标辨识度</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图标应用于【桌面卡片】场景，物理像素尺寸112px；</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图标应用于【Dock栏】场景，物理像素尺寸72px；</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图标应用于中控【应用中心】页面，物理像素尺寸144px；</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图标应用于副驾【应用中心】页面，物理像素尺寸108px；</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>3.2 通用图标</strong></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/bd508270d24a4f59a99be082c9464b9c.jpg?auth_key=1795678279-3af72e194bdc47f4bc50fecd14d25927-0-b7fddd7f25091b483be7a813b30b996473645891940982ce28e0da7538a39feb\" alt=\"jpg.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1140.00px;height: 1379.01px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 3-1 前舱图标</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>3.3 第三方图标</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>各第三方图标需保持基本色调与默认图标一致</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/f378de3909e04c92a288f986d3358fba.jpg?auth_key=1795678279-904d2ed8ee334eb58a8f0cc0640782cc-0-1aa0c1eeb0ed7f3be27383656061725de54a0d7b5c0dc022f4e7d6c3ed992b87\" alt=\"5.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1146.96px;height: 158.19px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 3-2 第三方图标</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>4.</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px;\"><strong>预览图规范</strong></span></h2><table style=\"width: auto;table-layout: fixed;height:572\"><colgroup contentEditable=\"false\"><col width=147></col><col width=465></col><col width=470></col></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">类型</span></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">封面/手机预览图</span></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">主题预览图</span></th></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"3\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">切图尺寸</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">横屏：640*360px</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">横屏：1600*900px</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 36px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">竖屏：270*480px</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">竖屏：675*1200px</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 36px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">长连屏：860*312px</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">长连屏：5120*1600px</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">格式要求</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">png/jpg</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">静态：png/jpg</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">动态：横屏竖屏webp格式，长连屏pag格式</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 42px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">大小要求</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">大小200KB以内</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">png/jpg大小1MB以内，webp动图大小5MB以内</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 30px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">输出建议</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">静态预览图</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">建议动态预览图，选取精彩片段作为预览图即可。</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 39px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">应用场景</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/131d190723db4906b24c6a367bd35f78.jpg?auth_key=1795678279-b806e0e0d0e042438c223108e13cc546-0-de8156901ee5bbc676a67df9a5a56d8ffd5245041c9746a725e1122c154417d3\" alt=\"主题_精品首页 (10).jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/2b716725489347b8b0e66cc873f5d7ac.jpg?auth_key=1795678279-d59d197e8ca24a3a80513f8224960c43-0-a635b4bcade042cc7f8d9f91573d68459fe53f1499fb30d13dea3d1bad4a5762\" alt=\"推荐 (16).jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">表4-1预览图规范要求</span></p>"
}
